<Base title="Meet Kieran — Wardith" description="Wardith is run by Kieran Smith from the Wirral, helping UK service businesses understand and improve their visibility in AI answers.">
<section class="about-hero"><div class="wrap founder-grid"><img class="founder-home" src={business.founderPhoto!} alt="Kieran Smith, founder of Wardith" width="880" height="1100" /><div><p class="section-label">Independent. Based in the Wirral.</p><h1>A real person.<br /><em>Accountable<br />for the work.</em></h1><p class="lede">I’m Kieran Smith. I run Wardith, write the reports, and answer the emails.</p>{business.founderLinkedIn && <a class="text-link" href={business.founderLinkedIn}>Find me on LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>}</div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><h2>Why this work?</h2></div><div><p>When customers ask an AI assistant who to use, a business can be absent from the answer without knowing it. Wardith gives service businesses a way to investigate that, using recorded answers and checks of the information available about them.</p><p>I spent eight years in operations at {business.founderFormerEmployer}. Keeping information accurate across systems that don’t naturally agree was a large part of that work. It is a useful discipline for this one too.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section section--tint"><div class="wrap pathway-grid"><div><p class="section-label">What you can expect</p><h2>A report you can<br />check for yourself.</h2><p>Wardith is a small business. There are no client case studies to present yet. The published self-audit is there for you to inspect.</p></div><div><details class="disclose" open><summary>Evidence behind the recommendation</summary><p>Recorded answers and specific findings. If we can’t support a claim, it doesn’t belong in your report.</p></details><details class="disclose" open><summary>An honest stopping point</summary><p>The audit stands alone. If you don’t need more work, the report says so. You can take it to somebody else.</p></details><details class="disclose" open><summary>Clear limits</summary><p>We work on information and website issues we can influence. We don’t guarantee how an assistant will answer.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><h2>We started<br />with ourselves.</h2></div><div><p>Our original audit found enough confusion around the name Noven that we changed it. We kept the report public, including the result we didn’t want.</p><a class="text-link" href="/ask-your-ai/self-audit/">Read the original report <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</Base>
